  "solution": "**Given: T**\n\n** 2 - [ {(1)/(2) + (1)/(4) + (1)/(6) div ( {(3)/(4) - (1)/(2)} )} ]**\n\nConcept Used:\n\nFollow BODMAS rule to solve this question, as per the order given below,\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/a362b2dbc57f6e9b6ba80e0191e6f881d7f0133ec578707da9ca0acda51b96e6.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n 2 - [ {(1)/(2) + (1)/(4) + (1)/(6) div ( {(3)/(4) - (1)/(2)} )} ]\n\n⇒ 2 - [ {(1)/(2) + (1)/(4) + (1)/(6) div ( {(3-2)/(4)} )} ]\n\n⇒ 2 - [ {(1)/(2) + (1)/(4) + (1)/(6) div {(1)/(4)} } ]\n\n⇒ 2 - [ {(1)/(2) + (1)/(4) + (1)/(6) times {(4)/(1)} } ]\n\n⇒ 2 - [ {(1)/(2) + (1)/(4) + (2)/(3)}]\n\n⇒ 2 - [ {(6+3+8)/(12)}] \n\n⇒ 2 - (17)/(12)\n\n⇒ (24-17)/(12)\n\n⇒ (7)/(12)\n\n**∴ The value is (7)/(12)**",
